# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#

assertion  XSH.isnan.001
anchor     functions/isnan.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/isnan.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      2001
says       isnan() of a NaN and of its negation is non-zero, for each of the
           three floating types.
test       t/001-nan.c

assertion  XSH.isnan.002
anchor     functions/isnan.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/isnan.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      2001
says       isnan() of 0, -0, 1, -1, MIN, MAX, +Inf and -Inf is 0, for each of the
           three floating types.
test       t/002-not-nan.c
